# doc-engine cohesion lens

When editing product code under `src/doc_engine/` or its tests:

- Nest by **product capability** (bounded context), not grab-bag folders — see `DOMAIN_MAP.md`.
- Stable invoke: `python -m doc_engine.tools.<mod>` / `doc-engine …` stay green across moves (shim/façade) unless a deprecation Spec says otherwise.
- Cohesion over mechanical `part2` LOC chops; public-surface / façade poke gates are hard when in `pre_pr`.
- No new `utils/` packages; concept-named modules only.
- Update `docs/design/tools_bc_inventory.json` in the same commit when changing `tools/` membership.

